LINK ../station_maintenance/station_maintenance.html#sta_export

DESCRIPTION <b>sta_export</b> is one of a collection of tools developed
to manage station metadata in an Earthworm database.  <b>sta_export</b>
extracts all station metadata from an Earthworm database and
exports it to a flat file. Please see the details
page for more information.
